{"articleNo":"2890","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2890&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"그린에너지연계전공 이수신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.13","hit":"11043","attachments":[{"name":"연계전공이수신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2890&attachNo=2586"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011학년도 연계전공 이수신청 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011학년도 2학기 연계전공 이수 신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 희망</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 7. 15(금) ~ 7. 19(화)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 신청 자격 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3학기 이상 수료한 모든 재학생(비참여 학부･전공의 학생은 재정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">지원 등 혜택 없으나 연계전공 자격은 주어짐)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3.선발 자격 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청자가 정원을 초과할 경우 다음 각호의 기준을 순차적으로 적용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 참여학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직전 학기까지 이수한 성적의 평점평균</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 취득 학점 수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 취득 과목 수<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 선발 확정 예정일 : 2011. 7. 26(화)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 연계전공 명칭 및 이수 정원<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"255\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">연계전공 명칭(영문명)</s